This product includes software and design elements adapted from gpui, the UI
framework used by Zed (https://github.com/zed-industries/zed), which is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The adaptation is limited to the text pipeline: font discovery and shaping via
cosmic-text, glyph rasterization via swash, and the glyph atlas plus instanced
sprite rendering strategy. See crates/kasumi-paint/src/text.rs and
crates/kasumi-backend/src/atlas.rs.

The gpui source tree that was used as reference material during development is
not part of this project and is excluded from version control.

The Chromium-style smooth scrolling model in
crates/kasumi-tree/src/scroll_physics.rs is adapted from the scrollable widget
in iced (https://github.com/iced-rs/iced), licensed under the MIT License. The
animation curve, duration ramp and velocity-preserving retargeting derive from
Chromium's `cc/animation/scroll_offset_animation_curve`, which is licensed
under the BSD 3-Clause License (https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/).
